op_divider: the operating point of a resistor divider under a DC source (out = 5 * 2k/3k); the source and the load have names without a SPICE letter, so the rename map is under test
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
src (in 0) vsource dc=5.0
r1 (in out) resistor r=1k
lower (out 0) resistor r=2k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
